#: temp.glade:1629
msgid "PTXprint: Import Scripture..."
msgstr "PTXprint: Impor Kitab Suci..."

#: temp.glade:1702 temp.glade:1727
msgid "The Berean Standard Bible is\n"
"a Public Domain English Bible.\n"
"It is bundled with PTXprint but\n"
"needs to be installed in your\n"
"Projects folder.\n"
"\n"
"This is a good training project\n"
"and can also be used in diglots."
msgstr "Berean Standard Bible adalah\n"
"Alkitab bahasa Inggris yang berstatus\n"
"Milik Umum (Public Domain).\n"
"Alkitab ini disertakan dalam PTXprint,\n"
"tetapi perlu dipasang di folder\n"
"Proyek Anda.\n"
"\n"
"Ini adalah proyek latihan yang baik\n"
"dan juga dapat dipakai dalam diglot."

#: temp.glade:1711
msgid "Install Sample Text:\n"
"Berean Standard Bible"
msgstr "Pasang Teks Contoh:\n"
"Berean Standard Bible"

#: temp.glade:1723
msgid "Install BSB"
msgstr "Pasang BSB"

#: temp.glade:1776
msgid " OR "
msgstr "ATAU"

#: temp.glade:1819 temp.glade:14953
msgid "Locate..."
msgstr "Menemukan..."

#: temp.glade:1824 temp.glade:1842
msgid "After downloading a scripture text bundle \n"
"(.zip) file you need to tell PTXprint where \n"
"the .zip file is located so that it can install\n"
"it as a special resource project."
msgstr "Setelah mengunduh file bundel teks Kitab Suci\n"
"(.zip), Anda perlu menunjukkan lokasi file .zip\n"
"itu kepada PTXprint, supaya dapat dipasang\n"
"sebagai proyek sumber daya khusus."

#: temp.glade:1848
msgid "<b>Step 2</b>\n"
"Locate File:"
msgstr "<b>Langkah 2</b>\n"
"Temukan File:"

#: temp.glade:1862 temp.glade:1885
msgid "PTXprint will create this project within a \n"
"subfolder called '_PTXprint'. Use a short name\n"
"(8 characters or fewer is best) for the new project.\n"
"Do not use the name of an existing Project."
msgstr "PTXprint akan membuat proyek ini di dalam\n"
"subfolder bernama '_PTXprint'. Gunakan nama pendek\n"
"(sebaiknya 8 karakter atau kurang) untuk proyek yang baru.\n"
"Jangan gunakan nama proyek yang sudah ada."

#: temp.glade:1868
msgid "<b>Step 3</b>\n"
"Assign a Name\n"
"for the Project:"
msgstr "<b>Langkah 3</b>\n"
"Tetapkan Nama\n"
"untuk Proyek:"

#: temp.glade:1936 temp.glade:28865
msgid "Filename:"
msgstr "Nama file:"

#: temp.glade:1949
msgid "Primary DBL site"
msgstr "Situs DBL utama"

#: temp.glade:1955
msgid "There are hundreds of Scripture bundles available\n"
"at the Digital Bible Library website which you may\n"
"download and use in a publication. You must log in\n"
"to the site in order to access resources.\n"
"\n"
"Use resources which contain the text\n"
"(not just the audio) and preferably\n"
"select the USX download option.\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">Note: If this option is disabled, it is\n"
"due to the \"Disable ALL Internet Use\"\n"
"option which has been set on the\n"
"General section of the Advanced tab.</span>"
msgstr "Ada ratusan bundel Kitab Suci tersedia\n"
"di situs Digital Bible Library yang dapat Anda\n"
"unduh dan pakai dalam terbitan. Anda harus\n"
"masuk (log in) ke situs untuk mengakses sumber daya.\n"
"\n"
"Gunakan sumber daya yang berisi teks\n"
"(bukan hanya audio) dan sebaiknya\n"
"pilih opsi unduhan USX.\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">Catatan: Jika opsi ini dinonaktifkan,\n"
"itu karena opsi \"Disable ALL Internet Use\"\n"
"telah diatur pada bagian Umum\n"
"di tab Lanjutan.</span>"

#: temp.glade:1982
msgid "If you don't already have a Scripture Text Bundle, \n"
"then you can download a USX or USFM text\n"
"bundle from an online scripture repository."
msgstr "Jika Anda belum memiliki bundel Teks Kitab Suci,\n"
"Anda dapat mengunduh bundel teks USX atau USFM\n"
"dari repositori Kitab Suci online."

#: temp.glade:1987
msgid "<b>Step 1</b>\n"
"Download a Scripture\n"
"Text Bundle from an\n"
"Online Repository"
msgstr "<b>Langkah 1</b>\n"
"Unduh Bundel Teks\n"
"Kitab Suci dari\n"
"Repositori Online"

#: temp.glade:2005 temp.glade:5020 temp.glade:16478
msgid "Description:"
msgstr "Penjelasan:"

#: temp.glade:2018
msgid "Open.Bible site"
msgstr "Situs Open.Bible"

#: temp.glade:2024
msgid "There are hundreds of Scripture bundles\n"
"at the Open.Bible website which you may\n"
"download and use in a publication.\n"
"\n"
"Use resources which contain the text\n"
"(not just the audio) and preferably\n"
"select the USX download option.\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">Note: If this option is disabled, it is\n"
"due to the \"Disable ALL Internet Use\"\n"
"option which has been set on the\n"
"General section of the Advanced tab.</span>"
msgstr "Ada ratusan bundel Kitab Suci\n"
"di situs Open.Bible yang dapat Anda\n"
"unduh dan pakai dalam terbitan.\n"
"\n"
"Gunakan sumber daya yang berisi teks\n"
"(bukan hanya audio) dan sebaiknya\n"
"pilih opsi unduhan USX.\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">Catatan: Jika opsi ini dinonaktifkan,\n"
"itu karena opsi \"Disable ALL Internet Use\"\n"
"telah diatur pada bagian Umum\n"
"di tab Lanjutan.</span>"

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkpolyglot.py:1114 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:4853 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:4878
msgid "Do not use spaces or special characters"
msgstr "Jangan gunakan spasi atau karakter khusus"

#: temp.glade:2099
msgid "PTXprint is built with Python & PyGTK3, using Glade for\n"
"the user-interface. The PDFs are produced by enhanced \n"
"XeTeX macros (ptx2pdf) with a long and reliable history."
msgstr "PTXprint dibuat dengan Python & PyGTK3, menggunakan Glade untuk\n"
"antarmuka pengguna. PDF dihasilkan oleh \n"
"makro XeTeX yang disempurnakan (ptx2pdf) dengan sejarah yang panjang dan dapat diandalkan."

#: temp.glade:2103
msgid "PTXprint Homepage"
msgstr "Beranda PTXprint"

#: temp.glade:2143
msgid "PTXprint: Save Current Configuration As..."
msgstr "PTXprint: Simpan Konfigurasi Saat Ini Sebagai..."

#: temp.glade:2224 temp.glade:2246 temp.glade:3990 temp.glade:4013
msgid "Enter a name for the configuration to be saved.\n"
"\n"
"Note that only Roman/Latin names\n"
"are supported using: a-z A-Z, 0-9,\n"
"parentheses, underscores and hyphens.\n"
"Spaces are not permitted."
msgstr "Masukkan nama untuk konfigurasi yang akan disimpan.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Perhatikan bahwa hanya nama Romawi/Latin\n"
"yang didukung dengan menggunakan: a-z A-Z, 0-9, tanda kurung, garis bawah, dan tanda hubung.\n"
"Spasi tidak diperbolehkan."

#: temp.glade:2230
msgid "Configuration Name:"
msgstr "Nama Konfigurasi:"

#: temp.glade:2308 temp.glade:2353
msgid "PTXprint: Please Confirm..."
msgstr "PTXprint: Mohon Konfirmasi..."

#: temp.glade:2313
msgid "You are about to REMOVE this Configuration"
msgstr "Anda akan MENGHAPUS Konfigurasi ini"

#: temp.glade:2314
msgid "Are you sure you want to DELETE it?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda yakin ingin MENGHAPUSnya?"

#: temp.glade:2318 temp.glade:17258
msgid "Delete this Saved Configuration\n"
"\n"
"This also deletes the corresponding subfolder \n"
"of temporary files in the local\\ptxprint folder \n"
"but does not delete the previously created \n"
"PDF files which will remain in that folder."
msgstr "Hapus Konfigurasi yang Tersimpan ini\n"
"\n"
"Ini juga akan menghapus subfolder yang berisi file-file \n"
"sementara yang terkait di folder local\\ptxprint tetapi \n"
"tidak akan menghapus file-file PDF yang dibuat sebelumnya. \n"
"File-file itu akan tetap berada di folder tersebut."

#: temp.glade:2358
msgid "You are about to CREATE a diglot (or polyglot) configuration. This setting cannot be undone."
msgstr "Anda akan MEMBUAT konfigurasi diglot (atau poliglot). Pengaturan ini tidak dapat dibatalkan."

#: temp.glade:2359
msgid "Consider using the <b>Save As...</b> button to create a NEW Configuration Layout before proceeding to enable the Diglot. <b>Are you sure you want to CONTINUE?</b>"
msgstr "Pertimbangkan untuk memakai tombol <b>Save As...</b> guna membuat Tata Letak Konfigurasi BARU sebelum mengaktifkan Diglot. <b>Apakah Anda yakin ingin MELANJUTKAN?</b>"

#: temp.glade:2364
msgid "Unlike most other PTXprint settings (which can easily be\n"
"toggled on or off), the Diglot setting is special in that it\n"
"has to set up a number of other settings; and is very hard\n"
"to disable later. So only continue if you are sure that this\n"
"is what you need to do.\n"
"\n"
"It is highly recommended to first save the existing\n"
"configuration with a new name (like \"Diglot\") and\n"
"then proceed with the step of enabling this option.\n"
msgstr "Berbeda dari kebanyakan pengaturan PTXprint lainnya (yang mudah\n"
"diaktifkan atau dinonaktifkan), pengaturan Diglot bersifat khusus\n"
"karena harus mengatur sejumlah pengaturan lain, dan sangat sulit\n"
"untuk dinonaktifkan kembali. Jadi, lanjutkan hanya jika Anda yakin\n"
"ini yang perlu Anda lakukan.\n"
"\n"
"Sangat disarankan untuk lebih dahulu menyimpan konfigurasi\n"
"yang sudah ada dengan nama baru (misalnya \"Diglot\"),\n"
"lalu melanjutkan ke langkah mengaktifkan opsi ini.\n"

#: temp.glade:2409
msgid "PTXprint: Generate Front Matter"
msgstr "PTXprint: Hasilkan Bagian Depan Buku"

#: temp.glade:2494
msgid "BASIC: Front matter contains just a few\n"
"essentials with publication information"
msgstr "DASAR: Bagian depan buku hanya berisi beberapa\n"
"hal penting dengan informasi penerbitan"

#: temp.glade:2500
msgid "This option will create a simple verso page\n"
"containing essential copyright and licensing\n"
"information followed by a table of contents."
msgstr "Pilihan ini akan membuat halaman verso sederhana\n"
"yang mengandung hak cipta dan informasi lisensi \n"
"diikuti dengan daftar isi."

#: temp.glade:2518
msgid "ADVANCED: template contains several sections\n"
"(some of which require editing before use)"
msgstr "LANJUTAN: format berisi beberapa bagian (beberapa \n"
"di antaranya perlu disunting sebelum digunakan)"

#: temp.glade:2524
msgid "This option will create an extensive template\n"
"with multiple sections (each of which will start\n"
"on a new page in the final publication). You will\n"
"need to edit the sample text provided so that it\n"
"communicates in the required language(s).\n"
"You can also remove unwanted sections if they\n"
"are inappropriate for this publication.\n"
"Note: In order to make this template generic for\n"
"several different publications in this project, you\n"
"are encouraged to use \\zvar|variables\\*  which will be\n"
"replaced with publication-specific info when printed.\n"
"For example:\n"
"\\mt1 \\zvar|maintitle\\*\n"
"\\mt2 \\zvar|subtitle\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|maintitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|subtitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|languagename\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|copiesprinted\\*"
msgstr "Pilihan ini akan membuat format yang mengandung\n"
"cukup banyak bagian (masing-masing akan dimulai\n"
"pada halaman baru dalam terbitan akhir). Anda \n"
"perlu menyunting teks contoh yang disediakan agar\n"
"jelas dan wajar dalam bahasa yang diperlukan.\n"
"Anda juga dapat menghapus bagian yang tidak diinginkan \n"
"jika tidak pantas untuk terbitan ini.\n"
"Perhatikan: Untuk membuat format ini bersifat umum untuk\n"
"beberapa terbitan yang berbeda dalam proyek ini, Anda\n"
"dianjurkan untuk menggunakan \\zvar|variables\\* yang akan \n"
"diganti dengan info yang khusus untuk terbitan tertentu saat dicetak.\n"
"Sebagai contoh:\n"
"\\mt1 \\zvar|maintitle\\*\n"
"\\mt2 \\zvar|subjudul\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|maintitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|subtitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|nama bahasa\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|salinan dicetak\\*"

#: temp.glade:2556
msgid "Include sections for a separate cover page"
msgstr "Sertakan bagian untuk halaman sampul terpisah"

#: temp.glade:2561
msgid "(Not yet implemented)\n"
"Enable this option if you want to include the following\n"
"sections (used for creating a cover page):\n"
"\\periph Cover - detailing text and optional picture\n"
"\\periph Spine - text for the spine of the cover"
msgstr "(Belum diimplementasikan)\n"
"Aktifkan opsi ini jika Anda ingin menyertakan bagian\n"
"berikut (digunakan untuk membuat halaman sampul):\n"
"\\periph Cover - merinci teks dan gambar opsional\n"
"\\periph Spine - teks untuk tulang belakang cover"

#: temp.glade:2597 temp.glade:2965
msgid "Warning!"
msgstr "Peringatan!"

#: temp.glade:2612
msgid "This operation can overwrite\n"
"carefully crafted settings.\n"
"So choose carefully...\n"
"If in doubt, click Cancel."
msgstr "Proses ini dapat menghapus pengaturan\n"
"yang telah dibuat dengan teliti.\n"
"Jadi pilih dengan hati-hati...\n"
"Kalau belum pasti, klik Batal."

#: temp.glade:2627
msgid "DIGLOT: template for a Diglot or Polyglot publication\n"
"(deliberately fuller — delete sections you do not need)"
msgstr "DIGLOT: templat untuk terbitan Diglot atau Poliglot\n"
"(sengaja dibuat lebih lengkap — hapus bagian yang tidak Anda perlukan)"

#: temp.glade:2633
msgid "This option creates a DIGLOT / POLYGLOT front matter\n"
"template designed for publications with two (or more)\n"
"languages or scripts. It is deliberately more complete\n"
"than the BASIC and ADVANCED templates because diglots\n"
"are inherently complex: two (or more) texts, often two\n"
"contents lists, two prefaces, sometimes two scripts and\n"
"two writing directions. Delete the sections you do not need.\n"
"\n"
"Like the ADVANCED template it uses \\zvar|variables\\* and\n"
"\\zglot|L\\* / \\zglot|R\\* markers for column-specific content,\n"
"so it requires editing before use and is NOT suitable for\n"
"use inside Paratext without prior modification.\n"
"\n"
"If this option is disabled, the Diglot setting is not\n"
"enabled for this configuration."
msgstr "Pilihan ini membuat templat Bagian Depan Buku untuk DIGLOT / POLIGLOT,\n"
"yang dirancang untuk terbitan dengan dua (atau lebih)\n"
"bahasa atau aksara. Templat ini sengaja dibuat lebih lengkap\n"
"daripada templat BASIC dan ADVANCED karena diglot\n"
"pada dasarnya rumit: dua (atau lebih) teks, sering kali dua\n"
"daftar isi, dua kata pengantar, kadang dua aksara dan\n"
"dua arah penulisan. Hapus bagian yang tidak Anda perlukan.\n"
"\n"
"Seperti templat ADVANCED, templat ini memakai \\zvar|variables\\* dan\n"
"penanda \\zglot|L\\* / \\zglot|R\\* untuk isi khusus kolom,\n"
"jadi perlu disunting sebelum dipakai dan TIDAK cocok dipakai\n"
"di dalam Paratext tanpa modifikasi terlebih dahulu.\n"
"\n"
"Jika pilihan ini dinonaktifkan, pengaturan Dua Bahasa tidak\n"
"aktif untuk konfigurasi ini."

#: temp.glade:2662
msgid "PARATEXT: Make a copy of the Project's FRT book\n"
"(which may be edited to make use of \\zvar|variables\\*)"
msgstr "PARATEXT: Buat salinan buku FRT proyek ini (yang \n"
"dapat disunting untuk menggunakan \\zvar|variables\\*)"

#: temp.glade:2668
msgid "This option will create a COPY of the Paratext project's\n"
"FRT book to be used exclusively by PTXprint. You can\n"
"edit the front matter to make use of PTXprint-specific\n"
"\\zvar|variables\\* but note that none of these edits will\n"
"be reflected in Paratext. In addition, if you edit the FRT\n"
"book in Paratext, those changes will not be reflected\n"
"here until you regenerate this (local) Front Matter.\n"
"\n"
"If option is disabled, it is due to not having a FRT book\n"
"in the Paratext project (so there is nothing to import)."
msgstr "Pilihan ini akan membuat SALINAN dari kitab FRT proyek Paratext\n"
"untuk digunakan secara eksklusif oleh PTXprint. Anda\n"
"dapat menyunting bagian depan itu untuk menggunakan\n"
"\\zvar|variables\\* yang khusus untuk PTXprint, tetapi ingat bahwa\n"
"tidak satu pun dari perubahan itu akan tampak di Paratext. Selain itu, jika Anda menyunting kitab FRT\n"
"di Paratext, perubahan tersebut tidak akan terlihat di sini sampai Anda\n"
"membuat ulang Bagian Depan Buku (lokal) ini.\n"
"\n"
"Jika pilihan ini dinonaktifkan, itu karena proyek Paratext tidak memiliki\n"
"kitab FRT (sehingga tidak ada yang dapat diimpor)."

