msgid "Copyright Information"
msgstr "Informasi Hak Cipta"

#: temp.glade:7519
msgid "Copy the copyright (credit) information\n"
"of each picture."
msgstr "Salin informasi hak cipta (penghargaan)\n"
"setiap gambar."

#: temp.glade:7596
msgid "How to handle differences:"
msgstr "Bagaimana menangani perbedaan:"

