#: temp.glade:7977
msgid "Replace the front matter in the target with\n"
"the source's, instead of only adding the\n"
"parts that are missing."
msgstr "Ganti bagian depan buku di target dengan\n"
"milik sumber, bukan hanya menambahkan\n"
"bagian yang hilang."

#: temp.glade:7992
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan lanjutan"

#: temp.glade:7996
msgid "This includes everything on the Advanced tab\n"
"with the exception of Custom Script processing\n"
"and Customized Styles (custom.sty)."
msgstr "Ini termasuk semua yang ada di tab Lanjutan\n"
"kecuali pemrosesan Sistem Tulisan Khusus\n"
"dan Gaya Khusus (custom.sty)."

#: temp.glade:8022
msgid "Cover settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan sampul"

#: temp.glade:8025
msgid "Import the cover settings, cover styles\n"
"and the cover pages of the front matter."
msgstr "Impor pengaturan sampul, gaya sampul,\n"
"dan halaman sampul dari bagian depan buku."

#: temp.glade:8040
msgid "Front +Back Matter"
msgstr "Bagian Depan + Belakang"

#: temp.glade:8044
msgid "This includes most of the settings on\n"
"the Peripherals tab, but not the Variables\n"
"and Values. Front Matter and also Section\n"
"Introductions are included in this."
msgstr "Ini termasuk sebagian besar pengaturan pada\n"
"tab Sampingan, tetapi bukan pada tab Variabel\n"
"dan Nilai. Materi Depan dan juga Perkenalan \n"
"Bagian termasuk di dalamnya."

#: temp.glade:8072
msgid "Custom Script"
msgstr "Skrip Khusus"

#: temp.glade:8077
msgid "This includes the Custom Script processing\n"
"defined on the Advanced tab.\n"
"\n"
"Note that it is not possible to extract a\n"
"custom script from a PDF file, which is\n"
"why this option is sometimes disabled."
msgstr "Ini termasuk pemrosesan Skrip Kustom\n"
"yang ditentukan pada tab Lanjutan.\n"
"\n"
"Perhatikan bahwa tidak mungkin mengekstrak skrip kustom\n"
"dari file PDF, itulah\n"
"alasan mengapa opsi ini terkadang dinonaktifkan."

#: temp.glade:8094
msgid "Borders + Decorations"
msgstr "Batas + Hiasan"

#: temp.glade:8098
msgid "This includes the various decorative\n"
"borders and other ornamental features\n"
"including section headers, end-of-book\n"
"and verse number decorators."
msgstr "Ini termasuk berbagai hiasan\n"
"perbatasan dan fitur ornamen lainnya\n"
"termasuk tajuk bagian, akhir buku\n"
"dan penghias nomor ayat."

#: temp.glade:8113
msgid "Variables + Meta Data"
msgstr "Variabel + Meta Data"

#: temp.glade:8116
msgid "Import the variables (Peripherals tab) and the\n"
"publication details: copyright statement,\n"
"licence, colophon and configuration notes.\n"
"The book selection and any password are not imported."
msgstr "Impor variabel (tab Peripherals) dan\n"
"rincian terbitan: pernyataan hak cipta,\n"
"lisensi, kolofon, dan catatan konfigurasi.\n"
"Pilihan kitab dan kata sandi tidak diimpor."

#: temp.glade:8144
msgid "Texpert Hacks"
msgstr "TeXpert Hacks"

#: temp.glade:8147
msgid "Import the expert TeX (TeXpert) settings."
msgstr "Impor pengaturan TeX tingkat lanjut (TeXpert)."

#: temp.glade:8160
msgid "Finishing settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan untuk Penyelesaian"

#: temp.glade:8164
msgid "This includes everything on the Finishing tab."
msgstr "Ini mencakup semua hal di tab Penyelesaian."

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkstyleditor.py:74 lib/ptxprint/gtkstyleditor.py:130
msgid "Other"
msgstr "Lainnya"

#: temp.glade:8210
msgid "Use the Other tab of this dialog to\n"
"choose more groups of settings.\n"
"If this is not ticked, none of the\n"
"boxes on the Other tab are used."
msgstr "Gunakan tab Other di dialog ini untuk\n"
"memilih lebih banyak kelompok pengaturan.\n"
"Jika tidak dicentang, semua kotak\n"
"di tab Other tidak digunakan."

#: temp.glade:8244
msgid "This option is automatically enabled when the target\n"
"Configuration does not already exist; or\n"
"when exporting to an external folder of settings."
msgstr "Pilihan ini otomatis diaktifkan ketika Konfigurasi\n"
"target belum ada; atau\n"
"ketika mengekspor ke folder pengaturan eksternal."

#: temp.glade:8262
msgid "Everything"
msgstr "Semua"

#: temp.glade:8266
msgid "Import all settings and files of the\n"
"source configuration, whatever the\n"
"other boxes say."
msgstr "Impor semua pengaturan dan file dari\n"
"konfigurasi sumber, apa pun\n"
"isi kotak lainnya."

#: temp.glade:8322
msgid "Whole Bible"
msgstr "Alkitab Antero"

#: temp.glade:8326
msgid "Paratext Project"
msgstr "Proyek Paratext"

#: temp.glade:8330
msgid "This Publication"
msgstr "Terbitan ini"

#: lib/ptxprint/pdf_viewer.py:35 lib/ptxprint/pdf_viewer.py:36
msgid "Center"
msgstr "Di Tengah"

#: temp.glade:8369 temp.glade:12949 temp.glade:14316
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

#: temp.glade:8433
msgid "Pick a Font (and Typeface)"
msgstr "Pilih Font (dan Gaya Font)"

#: temp.glade:8508
msgid "Choose a font from the installed fonts.\n"
"Fonts shown in BOLD have all 4 typefaces.\n"
"\n"
"If you cannot locate the desired font\n"
"in this list, then it is quite likely that\n"
"it has not been installed \"For all Users\"\n"
"in the Windows system."
msgstr "Pilih font dari daftar font yang terpasang.\n"
"Font yang ditampilkan dengan huruf TEBAL memiliki keempat gaya huruf.\n"
"\n"
"Kalau Anda tidak menemukan font yang diinginkan\n"
"di daftar ini, kemungkinan besar font tersebut belum dipasang\n"
"\"Untuk Semua Pengguna\" di sistem Windows."

#: temp.glade:8544
msgid "Fonts which have all 4 typefaces\n"
"(regular, bold, italic, and bold-italic)\n"
"are shown in BOLD in the list above.\n"
"\n"
"If you cannot locate the desired font\n"
"in this list, then it is quite likely that\n"
"it has not been installed \"For all Users\"\n"
"in the Windows system."
msgstr "Font yang memiliki 4 gaya font\n"
"(biasa, tebal, miring, dan tebal-miring)\n"
"ditampilkan deng huruf tebal di daftar di atas.\n"
"\n"
"Kalau Anda tidak melihat font yang diinginkan\n"
"di daftar ini, mungkin font tersebut belum dipasang\n"
"\"Untuk Semua Pengguna\" di komputer ini."

#: temp.glade:8555
msgid "Typeface:"
msgstr "Gaya Fon:"

#: temp.glade:8588
msgid "Type the start of a font name\n"
"to jump to it in the list."
msgstr "Ketik awal nama font\n"
"untuk langsung menuju ke font itu di daftar."

#: temp.glade:8642 temp.glade:8662
msgid "If the required font doesn't have a BOLD typeface, you can use this setting to create the BOLD effect. (For example, setting Embolden to 1.6 would thicken the Regular typeface making it appear as bold.)"
msgstr "Kalau font yang diperlukan tidak ada gaya TEBAL, Anda dapat menggunakan pengaturan ini untuk meniru gaya tebal. (Misalnya, mengatur \"Membuat Tebal\" menjadi 1,6 akan membuat gaya font Biasa kelihatan seperti gaya font Tebal.)"

#: temp.glade:8644
msgid "Embolden"
msgstr "Membuat Tebal"

#: temp.glade:8685 temp.glade:8707
msgid "If the required font does not have an ITALIC typeface, you can use this setting to create the ITALIC effect. (For example, setting Slant to 0.15 would slant the Regular typeface by 15% making it appear as italic.)"
msgstr "Kalau font yang diperlukan tidak ada gaya TEBAL, Anda dapat menggunakan pengaturan ini untuk meniru gaya tebal. (Misalnya, mengatur \"Membuat Tebal\" menjadi 1,6 akan membuat gaya font Biasa kelihatan seperti gaya font Tebal.)"

#: temp.glade:8709
msgid "Slant"
msgstr "Membuat Miring"

#: temp.glade:8727
msgid "Fake Bold/Italic"
msgstr "Huruf Tebal/Miring yang Buatan"

#: temp.glade:8732
msgid "If the font you are using doesn't\n"
"have multiple typefaces (such\n"
"as Bold, Italic and Bold-Italic)\n"
"then you can \"fake\" these by\n"
"adding boldness and/or slant\n"
"to the regular typeface."
msgstr "Kalau font yang Anda gunakan \n"
"tidak ada gaya-gaya font (seperti \n"
"Tebal, Miring, dan Tebal-Miring), \n"
"Anda dapat menggunakan \n"
"pengaturan ini untuk meniru \n"
"gaya tebal dan/atau miring."

#: temp.glade:8765 temp.glade:8786
msgid "The shapes of the characters can be stretched\n"
"(larger) or condensed (smaller) to occupy\n"
"more horizontal space, or less (shrink text).\n"
"1.00 = 100% = normal\n"
"0.95 =   95% = shrink text\n"
"1.05 = 105% = expand text"
msgstr "Bentuk karakter dapat dibesarkan atau \n"
"dikecilkan untuk menempati lebih banyak \n"
"atau lebih sedikit ruang horisontal.\n"
"1,00 = 100% = biasa\n"
"0,95 = 95% = mengecilkan teks\n"
"1,05 = 105% = membesarkan teks"

#: temp.glade:8771
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "Rentangkan"

#: temp.glade:8792 temp.glade:12235 temp.glade:12255
msgid "1.00"
msgstr "1,00"

#: temp.glade:8834
msgid "You can enable/disable any font features \n"
"for the selected font. For example:\n"
"smcp=1, cv12=2\n"
"Use 'Select Features...' to choose them\n"
"from a list."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengaktifkan/menonaktifkan ciri-ciri\n"
"font untuk font yang dipilih. Misalnya:\n"
"smcp=1, cv12=2\n"
"Gunakan 'Select Features...' untuk memilihnya\n"
"dari daftar."

#: temp.glade:8849
msgid "Contextual Spaces"
msgstr "Spasi yang Lebarnya Dapat Berubah"

#: temp.glade:8854
msgid "Set this option if the font changes the width of \n"
"spaces depending on the text around them."
msgstr "Pilih pilihan ini kalau font mengubah kebesaran\n"
"spasi berdasarkan teks di kelilingnya."

#: temp.glade:8867
msgid "Graphite Rendering"
msgstr "Pelukisan Graphite"

#: temp.glade:8872
msgid "If you require this font to use\n"
"SIL's Graphite Rendering\n"
"technology, then enable this.\n"
"\n"
"Changing this clears the font features."
msgstr "Kalau font ini perlu menggunakan\n"
"teknologi Pelukisan Graphite\n"
"dari SIL, aktifkan pilihan ini.\n"
"\n"
"Mengubah pilihan ini akan menghapus ciri font."

#: temp.glade:8889
msgid "Select Features..."
msgstr "Pilih Ciri..."

#: temp.glade:8893
msgid "Choose font features (and the language)\n"
"from a list of those this font supports."
msgstr "Pilih ciri font (dan bahasa)\n"
"dari daftar ciri yang didukung font ini."

#: temp.glade:8910
msgid "All known unicode-encoded number/digit systems\n"
"are catered for. So if you don't want to use the\n"
"Latin/Arabic numbers [0-9], you can pick the\n"
"appropriate script here. (Make sure the font you\n"
"are using supports these digits too.)"
msgstr "Semua sistem karakter unicode yang diketahui telah\n"
"disediakan. Jadi jika Anda tidak ingin menggunakan \n"
"angka Arab [0-9], di sini Anda dapat memilih sistem \n"
"tulisan yang diperlukan. (Pastikan font yang Anda\n"
"gunakan mendukung angka ini juga.)"

#: temp.glade:8936
msgid "Digit mapping:"
msgstr "Penyesuaian angka:"

