#: temp.glade:12546 temp.glade:12624
msgid "Transparency or alpha value of the background \n"
"image: 0 is transparent, 1 is solid. This is useful \n"
"for turning black lines into a paler shade. \n"
"\n"
"Note that this will allow the background colour\n"
"to show through, even if the image is above\n"
"the background layer, so on a green background\n"
"black will become a darker shade of green, not grey."
msgstr "Transparansi atau nilai alfa dari gambar latar belakang:\n"
"0 = transparan, 1 = padat. Ini berguna untuk mengubah \n"
"garis hitam menjadi warna yang lebih pucat.\n"
"\n"
"Perhatian: Ini akan memungkinkan warna latar belakang \n"
"terlihat, bahkan jika gambar berada di atas lapisan latar \n"
"belakang, jadi pada latar belakang hijau, warna hitam \n"
"akan menjadi warna hijau tua, bukan abu-abu."

#: temp.glade:12575 temp.glade:12600
msgid "Some (rare) PDF line-art images do not set \n"
"the colour of their lines, relying instead on \n"
"the 'default' colour, which is normally black. \n"
"This control sets the default colour to something \n"
"other than black, and thus such images can be\n"
"recoloured with this option. If (as most PDF images \n"
"do) the image defines its own colour, this option \n"
"will have no visible effect at all. It is also possible\n"
"that an image will *partly* contain colour information, \n"
"but only starting part way through the file, a situation \n"
"that might produce unexpected results."
msgstr "Beberapa (tetapi jarang) gambar PDF seni garis tidak \n"
"mengatur warna garisnya, melainkan mengandalkan \n"
"warna standar, yang biasanya hitam. Pengaturan ini \n"
"menetapkan warna standar menjadi warna selain \n"
"hitam, dan dengan demikian gambar seperti itu dapat \n"
"diwarnai ulang dengan pilihan ini. Jika (seperti kebanyakan \n"
"gambar PDF) gambar menentukan warnanya sendiri, pilihan \n"
"ini tidak akan memiliki dampak yang terlihat. Ada juga \n"
"kemungkinan bahwa gambar akan *sebagian* berisi \n"
"informasi warna, tetapi hanya di sebagian file; situasi \n"
"itu mungkin menghasilkan hasil yang tidak diinginkan."

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkstyleditor.py:319 lib/ptxprint/gtkstyleditor.py:803 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:4589
msgid "Color:"
msgstr "Warna:"

#: temp.glade:12612
msgid "Border Color"
msgstr "Warna Garis Tepi"

#: temp.glade:12633
msgid "Background Image Transparency:"
msgstr "Transparansi Gambar Latar Belakang:"

#: temp.glade:12645
msgid "Only relevant where there is both a background image\n"
"*and* a background color. Set whether the background \n"
"image should come above or behind the color. Line art \n"
"PDFs with a tranpsarent background may display better\n"
"above the color layer, as the color layer will not then \n"
"wash them out, but .JPGs are probably better behind,\n"
"as .JPG images do not have transparency."
msgstr "Hanya relevan jika ada gambar latar *dan* warna latar \n"
"belakang. Atur apakah gambar latar belakang harus \n"
"berada di depan atau di belakang warna. PDF seni garis \n"
"dengan latar belakang transparan mungkin tampilnya \n"
"lebih baik di depan lapisan warna, karena lapisan warna \n"
"tidak akan memucatkannya, tetapi gambar .JPG mungkin \n"
"lebih baik di belakang, karena gambar .JPG tidak memiliki \n"
"sifat transparansi."

#: temp.glade:12653
msgid "Layer\n"
"Order:"
msgstr "Urutan\n"
"Lapisan:"

#: temp.glade:12667
msgid "Only relevant where there is both a background image\n"
"*and* a background color. Set whether the background \n"
"image should come above or behind the color. Line art \n"
"PDFs with a transparent background may display better\n"
"above the color layer, as the color layer will not then \n"
"wash them out, but .JPGs are probably better behind,\n"
"as .JPG images do not have transparency."
msgstr "Hanya relevan jika ada gambar latar belakang\n"
"*dan* warna latar belakang. Atur apakah gambar latar belakang\n"
"berada di atas atau di belakang warna. PDF seni garis\n"
"dengan latar belakang transparan mungkin tampil lebih baik\n"
"di atas lapisan warna, karena lapisan warna tidak akan\n"
"memucatkannya, tetapi file .JPG mungkin lebih baik di belakang,\n"
"karena gambar .JPG tidak memiliki transparansi."

#: temp.glade:12698 temp.glade:12718
msgid "Select what action should be taken if\n"
