#: temp.glade:33383 temp.glade:33595
msgid "If text is justified but Justify Paragraphs is turned off on the\n"
"Body tab then an alignment of Justified here is treated as \n"
"Left, (and maybe swapped if Right-to-Left).\n"
"\n"
"When the Writing system text flow direction is Right-to-Left\n"
"the interpretation of Left and Right is swapped. Top-to-Bottom\n"
"flow is treated as Left-to-Right.\n"
"\n"
"Inner vs Outer (used for Marginal Notes, Xrefs or Headings)\n"
"  Inner = closer to the center:\n"
"    In a 2-column layout: closer to the space between columns.\n"
"    In a 1-column layout: closer to the spine of the page spread.\n"
"  Outer = further from the center:\n"
"    In a 2-column layout: closer to the outer edge of the page.\n"
"    In a 1-column layout: closer to the outer edge of the page spread.\n"
"  Note: Marginal notes cannot switch sides mid-paragraph \n"
"             if the page or column changes."
msgstr "Jika teks diratakan kiri-kanan (rata penuh) tetapi Ratakan Paragraf dinonaktifkan\n"
"di tab Isi Utama, maka perataan Rata Penuh di sini diperlakukan sebagai\n"
"Kiri (dan mungkin dibalik jika Kanan-ke-Kiri).\n"
"\n"
"Jika arah alur teks sistem penulisan adalah Kanan-ke-Kiri,\n"
"makna Kiri dan Kanan dibalik. Alur Atas-ke-Bawah\n"
"diperlakukan sebagai Kiri-ke-Kanan.\n"
"\n"
"Dalam vs Luar (digunakan untuk Catatan Tepi, Referensi Silang, atau Judul)\n"
"  Dalam = lebih dekat ke tengah:\n"
"    Pada tata letak 2 kolom: lebih dekat ke ruang antara kolom.\n"
"    Pada tata letak 1 kolom: lebih dekat ke jilid sebaran halaman.\n"
"  Luar = lebih jauh dari tengah:\n"
"    Pada tata letak 2 kolom: lebih dekat ke tepi luar halaman.\n"
"    Pada tata letak 1 kolom: lebih dekat ke tepi luar sebaran halaman.\n"
"  Catatan: Catatan tepi tidak dapat berpindah sisi di tengah paragraf\n"
"             jika halaman atau kolom berubah."

