"secara manual selama proses penjilidan.\n"
"\n"
"Perhatikan bahwa sampul selalu diekstrak."

#: temp.glade:39229
msgid "Extra XDV Processing"
msgstr "Pengolahan XDV Ekstra"

#: temp.glade:39234
msgid "Enable processing of the intermediate xdv\n"
