msgid "Create Archive..."
msgstr "Membuat Arsip..."

#: temp.glade:40056
msgid "Create a ZIPped archive of all the files\n"
"required to replicate this configuration.\n"
"Useful for long-term archiving; but also\n"
"helpful when availing technical support.\n"
"The job is printed again first, so this\n"
"may take a while.\n"
"\n"
"Keep the size to a minimum by turning\n"
"off features (pictures?) that don't affect\n"
"the issue being reported.\n"
"\n"
"Email the ZIPped archive file to:\n"
"<a href=\"mailto:ptxprint_support@sil.org\">ptxprint_support@sil.org</a>"
msgstr "Buat arsip ZIP dari semua file\n"
"yang diperlukan untuk mereplikasi konfigurasi ini.\n"
"Berguna untuk pengarsipan jangka panjang; tetapi juga\n"
"berguna saat meminta dukungan teknis.\n"
"Pekerjaan dicetak ulang terlebih dahulu, jadi\n"
"proses ini mungkin memerlukan waktu.\n"
"\n"
"Jaga ukurannya seminimal mungkin dengan mematikan\n"
"fitur-fitur (gambar?) yang tidak mempengaruhi\n"
"masalah yang dilaporkan.\n"
"\n"
"Kirimkan file arsip ZIP ke email:\n"
"<a href=\"mailto:ptxprint_support@sil.org\">ptxprint_support@sil.org</a>"

